# Renault Clio I five-door hatchback, 1990-1998.
#
# The first Clio, replacing the 5: 3,709 mm long, 1,616 mm wide, 1,394 mm high,
# 2,471 mm wheelbase; 1.1-1.8 petrol and 1.9 diesel. European Car of the Year
# 1991 and a strong British seller through the 1990s.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Renault_Clio
#
# Colours: White, Red, Blue and Grey are documented Renault colours of the period.
#
# Weight: 160 in total (white 50, red 40, blue 40, grey 30).
#
# Speed 170 km/h; comfort 80/450 (line). Classes 0,1.
# Dates: 1990-1998 with a road tail to about 2008.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/renault-clio.blend. References:
# citycars/references/renault-clio/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

